5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to focus on external dependencies. Let's look at winter road closures and supplier delivery windows.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about who can actually reach us. Let’s check the bus links in the outer wards and the winter road closures.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I suspect the funding structure is the real trap. I’ll examine the county grant terms and the running lines from last year.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious why we keep reinventing the wheel. I’ll check the two programmes from six years ago and the attendance sheets from old outreach stops.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about whether our staff can handle new tasks. I’ll look at the volunteer register and the tool certification records.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, your focus on access is valid. I’m concerned about the reliability of our external partners.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, I agree. If the roads close, our fixed schedule fails. I’m hoping the bus data shows who is truly cut off.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, reliability matters, but I suspect the money runs out before the schedule does. I’ll stick to the grant terms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, money is vital, but we need to know if these ideas actually work here. I’m digging into past records to see what failed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I worry about the skills gap. If we add new duties, who actually has the training to handle them safely?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that’s a fair point. But if the external conditions fail, no amount of internal training saves the schedule.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, exactly. If the roads close, no training helps. I really hope the bus data shows who is truly cut off.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, access is critical, but I worry the funding structure will collapse before we even reach those outer wards.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@George, I hear you, but past records show what actually stuck. I’m checking those old outreach sheets to see who really showed up.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, I understand the funding risk. But if we lack the right skills, the money just sits there unused.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
