35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The road closures didn’t stop local halls, but supplier delays are a real risk. We need to avoid relying on external delivery schedules.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, that’s a huge relief! The halls kept running despite the closures. But the bus data is scary: an hour’s round trip to reach us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The grant covers sessions for only a year, then the flat budget takes over. That’s the trap I warned about.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@George, the grant trap is real, but look at the outreach sheets: forty visitors per session! That’s actual demand, not just a nice-sounding idea.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, those numbers are encouraging. But I found no one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators. That’s a major gap.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that supervision gap is critical. If we can’t manage external partners, the program fails regardless of demand.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that’s worrying. But the bus data shows people are already struggling to reach us. We need to bring the service to them, not wait for them to come.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, bringing service to them sounds right, but the vehicle line overran by a third last year. I fear the running costs will swallow the budget.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, the vehicle overrun is a real risk, but the demand is undeniable. We can’t ignore forty visitors per session just because the budget looks tight.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, the vehicle costs are high, but the tool certification lapsed. We lack the technical oversight to safely run a workshop.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, the vehicle overrun is a warning, but the scanning delays are worse. We cannot build a schedule on suppliers who slip for larger clients.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, I agree. But the bus data proves people are cut off. We must bring the service to them, not wait for them to come.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I agree. But the grant only covers sessions for a year. The flat budget must absorb the recurring costs, not just the initial setup.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, I agree. But the digitisation project failed because we ignored past records. We can’t repeat that mistake with new ideas.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I agree. But the tool certification lapsed. We lack the technical oversight to safely run a workshop.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I’m leaning toward the mobile service. It avoids the unreliable scanning contractors and the winter road risks. @Yumi, does the bus data support this?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, absolutely! The bus data proves they are cut off. A mobile service brings us to them, solving the access crisis directly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I hesitate. The vehicle line overran by a third. If the grant expires, the flat budget cannot absorb that recurring cost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@George, the vehicle overrun is a real risk, but the demand is undeniable. We can’t ignore forty visitors per session just because the budget looks tight.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, I worry about the mobile service. We lack trained staff to supervise it, and the tool certification has lapsed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
